{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00880",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.61,
      "end_seconds": 16.46,
      "duration_seconds": 14.85,
      "text": "Well, doctor, you know how it is, I came in last month about my back and now there's a new thing, a numb patch on my thigh."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.8,
      "end_seconds": 25.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Right, let's look at the new thing first. Which thigh, and where exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.88,
      "end_seconds": 36.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "The left one, on the outside. About the size of my palm. It feels like it's been to the dentist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.19,
      "end_seconds": 43.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.47,
      "end_seconds": 56.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "Oh, a few weeks ago? Maybe longer, my daughter thinks it was when we went on holiday. I honestly couldn't say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.99,
      "end_seconds": 62.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Is it getting bigger, or staying the same?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.56,
      "end_seconds": 66.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Staying the same, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.69,
      "end_seconds": 75.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Any weakness in the leg, or pain going down from your back?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.68,
      "end_seconds": 83.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "No weakness. No pain in the leg at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.83,
      "end_seconds": 89.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Any problems passing water or opening your bowels?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.38,
      "end_seconds": 95.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "No, nothing at all in that department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.53,
      "end_seconds": 103.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "How has your back been since the last visit? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.23,
      "end_seconds": 111.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Much better, thank you. The physio helped. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.99,
      "end_seconds": 118.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Good. What medicines are you taking now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.83,
      "end_seconds": 133.11,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "Naproxen, 500 mg, twice a day, with food. And a tablet for the nerves, amitriptyline, 10 mg, at night. Or was it 25? My wife has the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.03,
      "end_seconds": 142.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "We'll check the dose on the box next time. Any other medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.61,
      "end_seconds": 154.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Diabetes, for six years. High blood pressure. And I had a slipped disc some years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.7,
      "end_seconds": 159.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Thank you. Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.0,
      "end_seconds": 165.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Used to. I gave up fifteen years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.87,
      "end_seconds": 172.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Let me check your pulse and pressure first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.28,
      "end_seconds": 186.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.03,
      "end_seconds": 193.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Pulse 76, blood pressure 138 over 84."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.96,
      "end_seconds": 197.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Is that fine? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.5,
      "end_seconds": 213.93,
      "duration_seconds": 14.43,
      "text": "Reasonable. Now I'd like to touch the patch on your thigh with a cotton wool and a pin. Tell me what you feel. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.56,
      "end_seconds": 233.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.67,
      "end_seconds": 247.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.24,
      "text": "There is reduced sensation to light touch and pinprick over the outer left thigh, and the rest of the leg is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.09,
      "end_seconds": 252.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "What does that mean? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.42,
      "end_seconds": 266.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.69,
      "text": "It's a pattern we see when a small skin nerve is squeezed, often called meralgia paraesthetica. Diabetes can make it more likely."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.74,
      "end_seconds": 271.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Is it serious? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.72,
      "end_seconds": 284.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.93,
      "text": "It isn't dangerous, and it often settles. I'd like to check your blood sugar and your B12 with a blood test."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.52,
      "end_seconds": 289.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Fine. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.98,
      "end_seconds": 300.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Avoid tight belts and trousers, and I'll ask the physio to look at it too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.27,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
